WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.247
Customer saamne hai aur printer ruk gaya?

00:00:03.247 --> 00:00:06.299
Hex Security computer, printer aur network

00:00:06.299 --> 00:00:08.527
theek karne mein help karti hai.

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:11.592
Pehle print queue aur computer ki setting

00:00:11.592 --> 00:00:14.005
check karte hain. Dekhte hain ki bill

00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:17.042
printer tak pahunch raha hai ya wahin atka hai.

00:00:17.382 --> 00:00:20.176
Kabhi dikkat connection mein hoti hai.

00:00:20.176 --> 00:00:22.802
Cable ya Wi-Fi check karte hain, phir

00:00:22.802 --> 00:00:26.274
dekhte hain ki machine network par dikh rahi hai.

00:00:26.614 --> 00:00:29.513
Ab ek test bill print karte hain. Paper

00:00:29.513 --> 00:00:33.137
bahar aaya, aur poori detail sahi dikh rahi hai.

00:00:33.477 --> 00:00:36.131
Staff apne computer se bill chala kar

00:00:36.131 --> 00:00:38.871
dekhta hai. Hum batate hain ki aage koi

00:00:38.871 --> 00:00:41.868
error aaye to kaun si detail share karein.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:45.235
Office ya shop ke liye IT support chahiye?

00:00:45.235 --> 00:00:48.176
Neeche contact karein, aur batayein kis

00:00:48.176 --> 00:00:49.819
device par dikkat hai.
